  "title": "C xlalloc : Safe and Efficient Memory Allocation for a CXL Pod",
  "abstract": "A Compute Express Link (CXL) pod is a group of hosts that share CXL-attached memory. A memory allocator for a CXL pod faces novel challenges: (1) CXL devices may not fully support inter-host hardware cache coherence (HWcc), (2) the allocator may be concurrently accessed from different processes, and (3) with more hosts, failures become more likely.",
